{    RDEFINE SDSF.OPER CLASS(FACILITY) UACC(NONE)
{    PERMIT SDSF.OPER CLASS(FACILITY) ID(OPER) ACCESS(UPDATE)
}  The installation guide of SDSF describes it.
}
